%% One event, end to end.
%% Rendered by GoLand's Mermaid support; also renders on GitHub.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant FB as Fluent Bit
    participant API as adapters/httpapi
    participant ING as application/ingest
    participant REG as rule registry
    participant ST as state store
    participant FL as domain/flow
    participant DR as application/deliver
    participant OS as OpenSearch

    FB->>API: POST /v1/events
    API->>ING: raw document plus observed_at
    ING->>ING: capacity check
    ING->>REG: which rule owns this event?

    alt no correlation key resolves
        ING->>DR: hand to pass-through buffer
        Note over ING,DR: memory only, never written to disk
        ING-->>API: passed_through
    else a rule claims it
        REG-->>ING: rule plus correlation key
        ING->>ST: begin transaction
        ST-->>ING: existing flow, or none
        ING->>FL: apply the event
        FL-->>ING: stored, duplicate, or anomaly
        ING->>FL: should this flow close?

        alt still waiting
            ING->>ST: save flow and expiry entry
            ING-->>API: correlated
        else closing
            ING->>ST: enqueue document in outbox
            ING->>ST: delete open flow
            ING-->>API: finalized
        end
    end

    API-->>FB: 202 Accepted

    Note over DR,OS: independently, on its own interval
    DR->>ST: pending outbox records
    DR->>OS: bulk index, outbox first then pass-through
    OS-->>DR: one status per item
    DR->>ST: delivered removed, retryable backed off, permanent dead-lettered
